sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-source-traceability> .
