        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Crossref confirmed Turing 1952, Schnakenberg 1979, Kondo and Miura 2010, Yang 2020, Germs 1972, and Penny 2014. Grant 1990 is cited by its PubMed URL because no DOI was returned. Image SHA-256 pins cover the species card, the CC BY-SA life restoration, and the CC BY 2.0 Corumbá photograph, and the restoration is labeled as not a fossil." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-source-traceability> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
